Many people are thinking to have a bike lane on the Main Street will be better and easier for the bikers. In my opinion I disagree with this idea. Let me explain why;

A lot of people loves to do sports in the morning which is good and healthy. It could be good to have a bike lane especially for them. But I checked the map which shows the plan for the lane and I saw that is blocking the road for passing cars. They don't have access at all for the Main Street which is making their road way longer. On the Main Street they have a bank, grocery store and many more than that. How people supposed to go shopping or the bank? Or how students can go to the library after school? What will happen to the people that they don't have a bike, they are old, or they don't like at all! It's closing all needs for the peoples in the city. We know it will be better for the traffic and for the air pollution, but it's not well to close the whole street for only them. Or another example I can give is the winter time. Especially in this cold weather nobody will see a single person that has a bike or going to get a coffee. 

In conclusion, I totally disagree to build a bike lane and to see the cars are not able to pass the road anymore. They have to find a better idea which doesn't make people life harder and also make bikers happy.

